From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Subject: [PATCH] dummy_netd: Forget the DNS listener source once it is removed

dns_proxy_stop() kept the id of the source it had removed, so a second
stop removed it again and glib complained that the source was gone.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 dns_proxy.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/dns_proxy.c b/dns_proxy.c
index 325ae12..4ebdca9 100644
--- a/dns_proxy.c
+++ b/dns_proxy.c
@@ -400,6 +400,7 @@ dns_proxy_stop(void)
 
     if (dns_listen_source_id) {
         g_source_remove(dns_listen_source_id);
+        dns_listen_source_id = 0;
     }
 
     if (fd >= 0) {
